# Code style: Google's C++ style. The C/C++ extension in VS Code picks this file up for
# "Format Document" (Shift+Alt+F).
BasedOnStyle: Google

# We also use the general Google Code Style with the following exceptions as they
# follow the Arduino generic code style better
#
# - Constants are named like THIS_IS_A_CONSTANT instead of kThisIsAConstant
# - Function names use camelCase instead of PascalCase
# - Header guards use #pragma once
# - Enum values are named like ThisIsAValue instead of kThisIsAValue
# - Variables, parameters and class/struct members use camelCase instead of
#   snake_case, without a trailing underscore for class members
#
# As in Google style, types use PascalCase and file names use snake_case.

